							</a></li><li class="o-nav__item c-page-menu__item"><button class="c-page-menu__button-link c-page-menu__button-link--desktop o-button" @click="clickItem($event)" data-click-item-target="tab-dates-and-times" data-remove-class-targets="page-menu,page-menu-button">								Book tickets
							</button></li></ul></div></template></v-tab-nav><section class="o-tab h-theme--tint2" id="content-overview"><h2 class="h-accessibility">About No Man&#039;s Land</h2><div class="o-panel o-grid h-theme--tint2"><dl class="c-meta o-grid__item"></dl></div><div class="o-panel o-grid h-theme--tint2"><div  id="block-133172" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><blockquote><p>No man’s land, which never moves, which never changes, which never grows older, which remains forever icy and silent.</p></blockquote><p>Hirst, an acclaimed writer, brings a down-at-heel poet, Spooner, back to his Hampstead home for a nightcap.  </p><p>As the night draws in, the alcohol flows and they contest memories false and true. Fact and fantasy blur until the arrival of two younger men transforms the evening entirely.</p><p>Directed by <strong>Patrick Marber</strong>, <strong>Harold Pinter</strong>'s funny and haunting masterpiece stars <strong>Simon Russell Beale, Rupert Everett, Olivier Huband </strong>and<strong> Jay Simpson.</strong></p></div><div  id="block-50313" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><p><i>With special thanks to our Season Supporter, Charles Holloway OBE </i></p></div><v-custom-css styles=""></v-custom-css><div  id="block-164151" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-3" data-block='["reusableContent"]'><p><i>We would also like to thank our Production Supporter Nicola Kerr</i><br /> </p></div><div  id="block-133189" class="o-block o-cast-and-creatives o-grid__item o-grid__item--full o-block--row-4" data-block='["text"]'><div class="o-panel o-grid"><ul class="o-profile-grid o-grid__item"><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/simon-russell-beale"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/No-Mans-Land/Headshots/Simon-Russell-Beale.jpg?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.5085&amp;fp-y=0.3593&amp;dm=1790679587&amp;s=bb310b59e20da01a3a38fa8a28740afd" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 50.85% 35.93%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Simon Russell Beale</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Hirst</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/rupert-everett"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/No-Mans-Land/Rupert_Everett.jpeg?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.5181&amp;fp-y=0.4559&amp;dm=1784650729&amp;s=ab26708d807d6ce9f60e515a12903c17" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 51.81% 45.59%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Rupert Everett</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Spooner</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/olivier-huband"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/No-Mans-Land/Headshots/Olivier-Huband.png?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.4847&amp;fp-y=0.3237&amp;dm=1790679587&amp;s=1a9726eb3f4a2d32ea57d5a5d8a74a04" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 48.47% 32.37%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Olivier Huband</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Foster</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/jay-simpson"><div class="o-image c-profile__image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/No-Mans-Land/Jay-Simpson.png?w=375&amp;h=375&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.4887&amp;fp-y=0.4017&amp;dm=1784650948&amp;s=4bef836e68b28a7814b90791c49c9461" width="375" height="375" alt="" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 48.87% 40.17%;"></div><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Jay Simpson</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Briggs</dd></dl></div></a></li></ul><ul class="o-profile-grid o-grid__item o-block"><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/harold-pinter"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Harold Pinter</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Writer</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/patrick-marber"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Patrick Marber</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Director</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><div class="c-profile"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Rae Smith</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Designer</dd></dl></div></div></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><div class="c-profile"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Zoe Spurr</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Lighting Designer</dd></dl></div></div></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><div class="c-profile"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Holly Khan</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Sound Designer</dd></dl></div></div></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><a class="c-profile" href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/profile/lotte-hines-cdg"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Lotte Hines CDG</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Casting Director</dd></dl></div></a></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><div class="c-profile"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Natalie Simone</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Associate Director</dd></dl></div></div></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><div class="c-profile"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Poppy Hall</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Costume Supervisor</dd></dl></div></div></li><li class="o-profile-grid__item"><div class="c-profile"><div class="c-profile__text"><h3 class="c-profile__name">Jamie Owens</h3><dl class="c-profile__meta"><dt class="h-accessibility">Role</dt><dd class="c-profile__role">Props Supervisor</dd></dl></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="o-tab" id="content-booking-info"><h2 class="h-accessibility">Booking information</h2><div class="o-panel h-theme--tint2"><div class="o-grid"><div  id="block-144806" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><p>If there are no tickets available for the date you're looking for, <a href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/ticket-availability">there are a few other options</a></p></div><div  id="block-133109" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><h3>Ticket Prices</h3></div><div  id="block-133110" class="o-block o-table o-grid__item o-block--row-2 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	" data-block='["text"]'><table><thead><tr><th class="text-left" width="20">Price A</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price B</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price C</th><th class="text-left" width="20">35 and under</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Standing</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-label="Price A"
								class="text-left">£76</td><td data-label="Price B"
								class="text-left">£59</td><td data-label="Price C"
								class="text-left">£30</td><td data-label="35 and under"
								class="text-left">£20</td><td data-label="Standing"
								class="text-left">£15</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div  id="block-133111" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-3" data-block='["table"]'><h4>Previews (first four performances)</h4></div><div  id="block-133112" class="o-block o-table o-grid__item o-block--row-4 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	" data-block='["text"]'><table><thead><tr><th class="text-left" width="20">Price A</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price B</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Price C</th><th class="text-left" width="20">35 and under</th><th class="text-left" width="20">Standing</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-label="Price A"
								class="text-left">£71</td><td data-label="Price B"
								class="text-left">£54</td><td data-label="Price C"
								class="text-left">£25</td><td data-label="35 and under"
								class="text-left">£20</td><td data-label="Standing"
								class="text-left">£15</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div  id="block-177850" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-5" data-block='["table"]'><p>Every booking made online, via telephone or in person will be subject to a £1.75 transaction fee<br />All exchanges and ticket resales are subject to a £2 per ticket admin fee.<br />Members at the Friends level, and above, do not pay transaction or admin fees.</p></div><v-custom-css styles=""></v-custom-css><div  id="block-133210" class="o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-3" data-block='["reusableContent"]'><h3>Access Performances</h3><p>Captioned performance<br />Monday 22 March 7:30pm<br /><br />Audio described performance<br />Saturday 3 April 2:30pm</p><p>Find out more about Access at the Donmar <a href="https://www.donmarwarehouse.com/your-visit/access">here</a></p></div><div  id="block-133201" class="o-block o-accordion o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-4" data-block='["text"]'><section class="o-accordion"><h3 class="o-accordion__title">Additional information</h3><details-utils animate><details class="o-accordion__item"><summary class="o-accordion__subtitle"><span class="o-accordion__subtitle-text">Performance times</span></summary><div class="o-accordion__text o-text"><p>Evenings Mon – Sat 7.30pm<br />Thursday &amp; Saturday matinees 2.30pm (from 20 February)</p></div></details></details-utils><details-utils animate><details class="o-accordion__item"><summary class="o-accordion__subtitle"><span class="o-accordion__subtitle-text">Last minute tickets</span></summary><div class="o-accordion__text o-text"><p>With Donmar Daily there are tickets available for our productions every day online. </p><p>A small allocation of tickets will be released every morning, Monday – Saturday, at 10am for performances seven days later. These are only available online, subject to availability and may not be available for some performances.</p><p>Any returned tickets are made available online to purchase. You can also ask in person at the Box Office.</p></div></details></details-utils><details-utils animate><details class="o-accordion__item"><summary class="o-accordion__subtitle"><span class="o-accordion__subtitle-text">Content warnings</span></summary><div class="o-accordion__text o-text"><p>To be confirmed</p></div></details></details-utils></section></div></div></div></section><section class="o-tab" id="content-discover-more"><h2 class="h-accessibility">Discover more</h2><div class="o-panel h-theme--tint2"><div class="o-grid"><div  id="block-134810" class="o-block o-image-block o-grid__item 	
			h-colstart--1 h-colend--10 h-tablet-colstart--1 h-tablet-colend--13 has-h-col
	 o-block--row-1" data-block='[]'><figure class="o-figure"><div class="o-figure__image"><div class="o-image"><img class="o-image__img" src="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/No-Mans-Land/Rupert-Everett-Simon-Russell-Beale-_No-Mans-Land_Donmar-Warehouse_Helen-Murray_1669.jpg?w=867&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.4984&amp;fp-y=0.3622&amp;dm=1784713715&amp;s=16d95a4f672566546e057317e99b501b" srcset="https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/No-Mans-Land/Rupert-Everett-Simon-Russell-Beale-_No-Mans-Land_Donmar-Warehouse_Helen-Murray_1669.jpg?w=867&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.4984&amp;fp-y=0.3622&amp;dm=1784713715&amp;s=16d95a4f672566546e057317e99b501b 867w, https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/No-Mans-Land/Rupert-Everett-Simon-Russell-Beale-_No-Mans-Land_Donmar-Warehouse_Helen-Murray_1669.jpg?w=720&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.4984&amp;fp-y=0.3622&amp;dm=1784713715&amp;s=9ff2aaf6a26f568d475bfc3d4d8ae236 720w, https://donmar-warehouse.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Productions/No-Mans-Land/Rupert-Everett-Simon-Russell-Beale-_No-Mans-Land_Donmar-Warehouse_Helen-Murray_1669.jpg?w=450&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fp-x=0.4984&amp;fp-y=0.3622&amp;dm=1784713715&amp;s=bd299d315578ad57a7570b155af299ab 450w" width="867" height="578" alt="" sizes="(min-width: 901px) 867px, (max-width: 900px) and (min-width: 601px) 720px, (max-width: 600px) 450px, calc(100vw - 40px)" loading="lazy" style="--object-position: 49.84% 36.22%;"></div></div><figcaption class="o-figure__text"><p class="o-figure__caption">Simon Russell Beale and Rupert Everett </p><p class="o-figure__credit">©  1</p></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section><section class="o-tab" id="content-dates-and-times"><instance-list default-tab="standard" :access-tabs-enabled=